  message: "Instance, measured 2026-09-24 after INV-midag's js fix: 9 typescript call edges in koel's components/utils/HotkeyListener.vue remain out of span. The anonymous callback symbols (_cb_onKeyStroke) are positioned WITHOUT the .vue <script> line_offset (e.g. span 40-40), while their calls carry it (lines 44-46, 60-61). Same offset inconsistency, on the symbol-creation side. These 9 are the only typescript out-of-span edges left on the corpus: 33 -> 9 after INV-midag."  # 4fa8
